# The API image is built with the whole project as its context (it needs design/sql/schema.sql).
# Allowlist: only what api/Dockerfile copies may reach the build. Never .env files, backups or the v1 project.
*
!ssms/api/pyproject.toml
!ssms/api/alembic.ini
!ssms/api/migrations
!ssms/api/app
!design/sql/schema.sql
**/__pycache__
